// The tutorial: a dip to learn jumping, a chasm with a floor and a stone, the bloom as a slab, an acid dip and a step to the door.
name First Bloom
rule B1234/S012345678
steps 2
hint Something bloomed from the stone down in the chasm. Plant on the stone, jump back up, Grow. The bloom is solid ground. Mind the green pool after it.
tip Two generations reach two cells each way: a bloom is five wide, and it began in its middle. Growth takes whatever stands inside it: be back on the rock before you grow.
intro You wake at the edge of a chasm with a lantern in your hand, and the lantern has a voice. Across the chasm, the faint outline of something that once grew.
outro The ground remembers. Where you planted the seed, the bloom grew back, and it holds your weight.
say wake|Awake. Good. I am the light; you are the legs. Down there is what is left of a bloom.
say plant|A seed. Now step away from it. Growth does not care what it grows through.
say grow|Watch the colours. Gold is right. Red is a guess.
say found|Exact. The door felt it open. Walk.
say die|The dark keeps what it takes. Not you, not yet.
map
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
........................................................
..s.................................................x...
##########..######.........##########..#################
##########..######...o.....##########..#################
##################...#.....##########~~#################
########################################################
end
